<title>USA: Millicom Q1 shr/loss $0.44 vs loss $0.16.</title>
<headline>Millicom Q1 shr/loss $0.44 vs loss $0.16.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.44     loss	 $0.16</p>
<p> Net loss		  21,110     loss	 7,826</p>
<p> Revs			70,226		   43,475</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  48,141		   48,002</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Quarters ended March 31.</p>
<p>Interest expense in Q1 1997 was $28.5 million, versus $7.3 million in Q1 1996.</p>
<p>The company, based in Luxembourg, saw total worldwide cellular subscribers increase to 582,625 in Q1 1997, from 301,558 a year earlier.</p>
<p>Full name of company is Millicom International Cellular SA</p>
</text>
